            "detailed_description": "&quot;Ghost Town Mine Ride &amp; Shootin' Gallery&quot; is a thrilling new interactive VR horror experience designed for the HTC Vive. In this approximately 25 minute scenario, you are exploring an abandoned tourist attraction, The &quot;Ghost Town Mine Ride &amp; Shootin' Gallery&quot;, built at the site of the old Black Rock Mines, which many claim is actually haunted!<br>Equipped with a flashlight and six shooter, you must keep your wits and have a steady aim if you hope to make it out alive! <br><br>Features both on-foot and on-rails sequences! <br><br>Warning!<br>This is a high speed horrifying thrill ride that could cause motion sickness for certain users. <br>User discretion is advised. <br>Vive Headset and controllers required!<br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR <br>Available for Arcades on SynthesisVR",
